Thought: The SMILES string "CCCCCCC/C=C(\\C)/C(=C(\\C)/C(=O)[O-])/C" is also valid. This structure contains C=C bonds and a carboxylate group, which aligns with the IR spectra data. I will validate the next SMILES string to continue the comparison.
